# Licensed brand typeface — NOT version controlled.
# The Microsoft Aptos EULA states: "No Distribution Rights. This agreement does
# not grant you a license to distribute nor sublicense all or part of the
# software to any third party." This repository is public, so committing the
# WOFF2 files here would distribute them to anyone who clones it.
#
# The files stay on disk and the site still works: every @font-face in
# assets/brand.css lists local() FIRST, so anyone with Microsoft Office renders
# Aptos from their own licensed copy. Everyone else gets the Segoe UI /
# system-ui fallback, which is the intended behaviour until the client
# confirms a web licence.
assets/fonts/
